# Scenario max-ticks-straddle (review WR-01, D-20, D-21): outcome pass, exit 0, run with
# --max-ticks 99. The run-to bound is 100 ticks and its last unit ends at tick 104, so the ceiling
# (99) sits inside the unit that reaches the bound: machine time did not stop below the bound, the
# run-to completed and the step is judged as usual, never as a budget timeout.
ivss 1
id max-ticks-straddle
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1.ivsc
run-to 100 ticks
assert halted == no
